mapping "YNA99.1" source="YNA99" target="SNOMED_CT:67954006" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        SE-mirror sctid
        67954006 = SNOMED CT 1202033006 67954006 and sctid 1202033006 =, BOTH ACTIVE in RF2 20260701
        (valid_end 2099-12-31, invalid_reason empty, rf2). Crosswalk-confirmed (67954006->4194777,
        1202033006->37162976). Defensible
        active standard targets exist (the source is covered by decomposing it into the
        two component harvests), so the mapping carries no invalid_reason. Target definitions: 67954006 = procurement of bone graft/tissue for
        transplant; 1202033006 = procurement of a soft-tissue (skin/muscle/fascia) flap for transplant.
        Why partial / : residual source (= other) + partial decomposition + neither target alone covers
        the combined harvest. The generic SNOMED CT 1202033006 67954006 1202033006 is broad; more specific
        flap concepts (180718007 skin+fascia, 180758009 skin+muscle trunk, 309069005 muscle flap) were
        considered but the source does not specify flap composition, so the parent 1202033006 is the
        defensible choice. Confidence per the residual+partial rubric. | Mirror-only lookup, citation
        empty.
        """
}
